{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Hat Guy": 13,
    "Marionette": 13
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7335601",
      "subQuestName": "Head for the vicinity of Lambad's Tavern to begin the tea party",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "733560101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "733560101": {
            "id": "733560101",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "This really is hard to believe. I never imagined I'd be sitting here drinking tea with you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560102"
            ]
          },
          "733560102": {
            "id": "733560102",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Is it really that strange? I just wanted to thank you for the core processing unit you provided for the numerological array.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560103"
            ]
          },
          "733560103": {
            "id": "733560103",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "And why do you keep talking like you know us inside out? You make it seem like you have a deep understanding.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560104"
            ]
          },
          "733560104": {
            "id": "733560104",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "I told you, I'm a good judge of character.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560105"
            ]
          },
          "733560105": {
            "id": "733560105",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "Still... Haha, you said it right. I shouldn't keep assuming I understand you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560106"
            ]
          },
          "733560106": {
            "id": "733560106",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Oh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560107"
            ]
          },
          "733560107": {
            "id": "733560107",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "Even compared to our last meeting, I feel like you've changed a lot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560108"
            ]
          },
          "733560108": {
            "id": "733560108",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Hmph! It doesn't matter how far back you want to \"compare,\" the only changes I've undergone are to accept the errors in my core and open my eyes to see a few things clearly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560109"
            ]
          },
          "733560109": {
            "id": "733560109",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "And what about you? As a fellow \"puppet\" of sorts, do you ever experience computational errors in your heart?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560110"
            ]
          },
          "733560110": {
            "id": "733560110",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "Hah... I experience far more than just errors!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560111"
            ]
          },
          "733560111": {
            "id": "733560111",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Do tell.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560112"
            ]
          },
          "733560112": {
            "id": "733560112",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "I don't think we know each other well enough for that just yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560113"
            ]
          },
          "733560113": {
            "id": "733560113",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Heh, have it your way. I was merely asking out of courtesy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560114"
            ]
          },
          "733560114": {
            "id": "733560114",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Regardless, it takes a good many detours before a puppet can find its heart. At least, it did for me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560115"
            ]
          },
          "733560115": {
            "id": "733560115",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "You seem to have a good relationship with your creator...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560116"
            ]
          },
          "733560116": {
            "id": "733560116",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I did. He gave me a lot of help and guidance, both in life... and after.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560117"
            ]
          },
          "733560117": {
            "id": "733560117",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "In that regard, there's a fundamental difference between us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560118"
            ]
          },
          "733560118": {
            "id": "733560118",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "...Oh. Is that so?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560119"
            ]
          },
          "733560119": {
            "id": "733560119",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I'm sorry. Even though we share some similarities as puppets, I shouldn't have assumed to know anything about you based on that alone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560120"
            ]
          },
          "733560120": {
            "id": "733560120",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "Don't worry about it. To borrow a phrase from you, I, too, have accepted my past errors.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560121"
            ]
          },
          "733560121": {
            "id": "733560121",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "It's just that I've taken too many detours already. I need to walk an even longer path to make up for them all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560122"
            ]
          },
          "733560122": {
            "id": "733560122",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "In that case... good luck? To borrow a phrase in return, I don't know you well enough yet to give any further advice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560123"
            ]
          },
          "733560123": {
            "id": "733560123",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "Haha... Well said."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7335602",
      "subQuestName": "Head for the vicinity of Lambad's Tavern to begin the tea party",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "733560201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "733560201": {
            "id": "733560201",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "We each have our own paths to walk. There's no need to say anything more. This tea is quite good, by the way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560202"
            ]
          },
          "733560202": {
            "id": "733560202",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "(Let's sit like this for a little while longer.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "733560204"
            ]
          },
          "733560204": {
            "id": "733560204",
            "speakerId": 22735,
            "speakerName": "Hat Guy",
            "text": "Alright, goodbye."
          }
        }
      }
    },
